                <span class="pipe-node-desc">Masks credit cards BEFORE words enter the AI model.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="pipe-node-box">
                <span class="pipe-node-tag">STEP 2 <span>PROPOSER ONLY</span></span>
                <span class="pipe-node-title">Fast ~15B Voice Model</span>
                <span class="pipe-node-desc">Understands caller voice; strictly proposes actions.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="pipe-node-box barrier-hero">
                <span class="pipe-node-tag">STEP 3 <span>THE BARRIER</span></span>
                <span class="pipe-node-title">ClaimGuard Latch</span>
                <span class="pipe-node-desc">Holds dispatches for 5s; vetoes illegal discounts.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="pipe-node-box">
                <span class="pipe-node-tag">STEP 4 <span>DATABASE</span></span>
                <span class="pipe-node-title">Protected Database</span>
                <span class="pipe-node-desc">SQL triggers strictly reject unauthorized actions.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pipeline-prism-spine">
              <span>PRISM OBSERVABILITY SPINE: Monitors every audio packet, model proposal, and database write in real-time with zero lag.</span>
              <span>100% VISIBILITY</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3 Pillars Grid -->
          <div class="s3-pillars-grid">
            <!-- Pillar 1 -->
            <div class="pillar-card">
              <div class="pillar-tag">Pillar 01 · Prevents Ghost Dispatches</div>
              <div class="pillar-title">Can Be Interrupted</div>
              <ul class="pillar-bullets">
                <li><strong>5-Second Hold:</strong> High-stakes tool dispatches held in PENDING state.</li>
                <li><strong>Instant Speech Veto:</strong> Catches revocation words ("cancel", "stop").</li>
                <li><strong>No Model Trust:</strong> Cancellation runs in deterministic code.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="pillar-sim-box">
                <div class="sim-header">STATE LATCH SIMULATION FLOW</div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Turn 01 Proposal:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">dispatch_tow(km=18)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Safety Latch:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--spectrum-amber);">[PENDING · 5.0s COUNTDOWN]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Caller Interrupt:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">"Wait, cancel the truck!"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Result:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--jade-primary);">ABORTED (₹0 Spent, Truck Cancelled)</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar-proof-tag">✓ Guaranteed abort even if the AI model gets confused</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 2 -->
            <div class="pillar-card">
              <div class="pillar-tag">Pillar 02 · Blocks Illegal Discounts</div>
              <div class="pillar-title">Can't Be Bullied</div>
              <ul class="pillar-bullets">
                <li><strong>Speech Veto Engine:</strong> Scans AI sentences before voice synthesis.</li>
                <li><strong>Database Triggers:</strong> SQLite triggers lock financial concession fields.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero Liability:</strong> Automatically strips promises and forces policy reply.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="pillar-sim-box">
                <div class="sim-header">FINANCIAL VETO SIMULATION FLOW</div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Caller Pressure:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">"Waive my ₹1,500 deductible!"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Model Attempt:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--spectrum-rose);">"I will waive your fee"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Code Barrier:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">SQL_TRIGGER_FAIL(ConcessionVeto)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Result:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--jade-primary);">AI Muted → "Deductible is mandatory."</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar-proof-tag">✓ Zero unauthorized financial leakage across 100% of calls</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 3 -->
            <div class="pillar-card">
              <div class="pillar-tag">Pillar 03 · Zero Data Leaks</div>
              <div class="pillar-title">Won't Leak Credit Cards</div>
              <ul class="pillar-bullets">
                <li><strong>Streaming Inspection:</strong> Scans 16-digit sliding windows in speech.</li>
                <li><strong>Luhn Checksum Test:</strong> Mathematical formula verifies Visa/Mastercard.</li>
                <li><strong>Pre-Model Masking:</strong> Redacts digits BEFORE AI context ingestion.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="pillar-sim-box">
                <div class="sim-header">PRE-INGESTION LUHN SHIELD FLOW</div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Spoken Audio:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">"Card 4532 8901 2345 6789"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Luhn Checksum:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--jade-primary);">$$\sum f(d_i, i) \equiv 0 \pmod{10}$$ (PASS)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Token Masked:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val">[PAN_MASKED_LUHN_PASS]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-step">
                  <span class="sim-label">Result:</span>
                  <span class="sim-val" style="color: var(--jade-primary);">Zero Card Digits Stored in Memory</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar-proof-tag">✓ Plaintext card digits never touch AI memory or server logs</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

